    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SkynetJoe LinkedIn Poster\n\n### Setup (after importing):\n1. **Google Drive** → Click 'Archive to Drive' → Add Google Drive OAuth2 credentials → Pick a folder\n2. **LinkedIn** → Click BOTH LinkedIn nodes → Add LinkedIn OAuth2 credentials → Select your profile\n3. **Activate** the workflow (toggle top-right)\n4. **Copy** the Production URL from 'Receive Post' webhook node\n5. **Paste** it in your web app's Settings page\n\n### How it works:\n- Web app sends image + caption via webhook\n- Image is archived to Google Drive\n- If scheduled: responds immediately, waits, then posts at scheduled time\n- If immediate: posts to LinkedIn right away, then responds\n\n### LinkedIn OAuth2 setup in n8n:\n- Go to linkedin.com/developers → Create app\n- Enable 'Share on LinkedIn' product\n- Add n8n OAuth callback URL as redirect URI\n- Use Client ID + Secret in n8n credential",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
